{"id":"163927","name":"芦笋炒香干","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/163927/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"芦笋","amount":"100克"},{"name":"香干","amount":"95克"}],"sub":[{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料：芦笋、香干","img":"images/163927/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将芦笋清洗一下、去除一些皮。","img":"images/163927/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放在案板上切成段，待用。","img":"images/163927/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将香干放在案板上切开，待用。","img":"images/163927/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"随后，将切好的芦笋下入沸水中焯一下，捞出。","img":"images/163927/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"烧锅倒油烧热，下入切好的香干翻炒一下。","img":"images/163927/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"接着，合入焯好的芦笋翻炒一下。","img":"images/163927/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"然后，加适量的蚝油。","img":"images/163927/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/163927/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"调味炒匀，即成。","img":"images/163927/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅，装盘。","img":"images/163927/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}